OL,3,GNEWSAIce hockey games to be held at OVO
OL,4,AHydro in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FIce hockey is to be played at the OVO
OL,7,FHydro in Glasgow first time this
OL,8,FDecember.
OL,10,FThree matches are to be played over two
OL,11,Fdays at Scotland's largest indoor
OL,12,Fvenue, with all the Scottish teams from
OL,13,Fthe Elite League competition taking
OL,14,Fpart.
OL,16,FOrganisers say the move will help to
OL,17,Fgrow the game, with the local Glasgow
OL,18,FClan team regularly selling out
OL,19,Ffixtures at the Braehead Arena.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
